Note on third-party assets / 第三方素材说明

This MIT license covers the source code of Whale Isle only. Character
artwork, sprites, animation clips and audio bundled under `assets/`,
`packages/pet-renderer/assets/` and any `pet-packs` directory are third-party
works and remain under their own licenses — predominantly
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike), which forbids
commercial use. See docs/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for per-asset attribution
and terms.

本 MIT 许可证仅覆盖鲸屿的源代码。`assets/`、`packages/pet-renderer/assets/`
与各 `pet-packs` 目录下的角色形象、精灵图、动作片段与音频属于第三方作品，
沿用其各自的许可证（主要为 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0，禁止商用）。逐项署名与条款见
